[h1]SaucedCarts v2.1.10[/h1]
[i]Released: 2026-05-30 (Hotfix)[/i]

[b]Fixes moving items between a bag on the ground and a held cart in multiplayer.[/b]

[h1]Bug Fixes[/h1]
[list]
[*][b]Multiplayer: items inside a bag on the ground can now be moved into a held cart[/b] — previously the transfer silently did nothing.
[*][b]Multiplayer: taking an item from your cart out into a ground bag now lands it in that bag[/b], instead of dropping it into your main inventory.
[/list]
[i](Single-player was never affected by either issue.)[/i]

[h1]Compatibility[/h1]
[list]
[*][b]Save-safe.[/b] No save-data changes — safe to upgrade mid-save.
[/list]
